        {
          "handle": "nvidianewsroom",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "In Tokyo today, NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang joined leaders from Fujitsu, Kawasaki Heavy Industries, FANUC, and Yaskawa Electric.   Together, they’re bringing physical AI from national ambition to the factory floors that power industries around the world.",
          "url": "https://x.com/nvidianewsroom/status/2077625109477556731",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-16T13:23:21.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 7173
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Similar to the panic over DeepSeek R1, some uneducated people think Kimi K3’s use of linear attention (KDA) is bad for NVIDIA, HBM, DRAM, and networking because it has relatively lower KV-cache requirements. The opposite is true, and we explain why below.  1/8",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2078250693010309260",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-18T06:49:11.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 3790
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Kimi K3 2.8T is so large that it will not fit on a single NVIDIA DGX B200, even at FP4. A GB300 NVL72, B300, or MI355X system is required, as each GPU has 288 GB of memory.  One optimization that could make Kimi K3 fit on B200 is to gang multiple nodes together and use a",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2077966560447074689",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-17T12:00:09.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 2283
        },
        {
          "handle": "nvidianewsroom",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "A warm California welcome from NVIDIA to  @SKhynix .",
          "url": "https://x.com/nvidianewsroom/status/2080499639149593034",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-24T11:45:42.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 1530
        },
        {
          "handle": "nvidianewsroom",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "And that makes three:  @Samsung  Chairman Lee Jae-Yong joined Jensen at NVIDIA as part of a full day with Korea’s technology leaders.",
          "url": "https://x.com/nvidianewsroom/status/2080762909882274109",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-25T05:11:51.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 1516
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Google has open-sourced their TPU Raiden inference optimization library. This is the equivalent layer of the stack to NVIDIA NIXL, where it provides KVCache transfer between prefill & decode instances & has primitives for KVCache offloading movements! It is great to see Google",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2086241160243118556",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-09T08:00:27.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 1327
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "FOXCONN HAS BROKEN DELL AND SUPERMICRO’S DUOPOLY BY WINNING ITS FIRST CONTRACT TO MANUFACTURE SPACEX’S NEXT-GENERATION AI SERVERS POWERED BY NVIDIA’S GB300.  - The project is reportedly worth approximately $52 billion, making it a massive deal.  - This order was not included in",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2078977947457966417",
